        "question_text": "For $15\\times\\square=435$:\n(a) Write a division sentence that finds the missing number.\n(b) Find the number and check your answer.",
        "solution_text": "(a) $\\square=435\\div15$.\n(b) $435\\div15=29$.\nCheck: $15\\times29=435$."
      },
      {
        "question_text": "For $\\square\\div18=26$:\n(a) Write a multiplication sentence that finds the missing number.\n(b) Find the number and check your answer.",
        "solution_text": "(a) $\\square=26\\times18$.\n(b) $26\\times18=468$.\nCheck: $468\\div18=26$."
      },
      {
        "question_text": "A school packs $943$ markers equally, with $41$ markers in each pack. The number of packs satisfies $943\\div\\square=41$.\n(a) Write a related multiplication sentence.\n(b) Find the number of packs and check your answer.",
        "solution_text": "(a) $41\\times\\square=943$.\n(b) $\\square=943\\div41=23$.\nThere are $23$ packs.\nCheck: $41\\times23=943$, so $943\\div23=41$."
      }
